{"id":"45fd1bad56780eb7","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-game2-run-compatible-strategy.md","title":"ZFC Game2 Run Compatible Strategy","display":"df-zfc-game2-run-compatible-strategy — ZFC Game2 Run Compatible Strategy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game2-run-compatible-strategy","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game2-run-compatible-strategy"],"display":"df-zfc-game2-run-compatible-strategy — ZFC Game2 Run Compatible Strategy","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-game2-play-branch.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-game2-player-turn.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game2-run-compatible-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game2-run-compatible-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game2-run-compatible-strategy — ZFC Game2 Run Compatible Strategy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d8896797273e3015\" href=\"?note=d8896797273e3015\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-game2-play-branch.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-game2-play-branch.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"747a450d8e1c888a\" href=\"?note=747a450d8e1c888a\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-game2-player-turn.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-game2-player-turn.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,T,i,x,\\sigma\\in V,\\ T\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega},\\ i\\in2\">\\(A,T,i,x,\\sigma\\in V,\\ T\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega},\\ i\\in2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2RunCompatibleStrategy}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2RunCompatibleStrategy}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayBranch}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayerTurn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayBranch}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayerTurn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}run\\text{-}compatible\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2RunCompatibleStrategy}_S(x,\\sigma,i,T,A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayBranch}_S(x,T,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\sigma,\n\\left\\{s\\in T:\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayerTurn}_S(i,s,A)\n\\land\\exists a\\in A\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in T)\\right\\},A\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\n(s^\\frown\\langle\\sigma(s)\\rangle\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(x\\upharpoonright n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\n\\to x(n)=\\sigma(x\\upharpoonright n)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}run\\text{-}compatible\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2RunCompatibleStrategy}_S(x,\\sigma,i,T,A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayBranch}_S(x,T,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\sigma,\n\\left\\{s\\in T:\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayerTurn}_S(i,s,A)\n\\land\\exists a\\in A\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in T)\\right\\},A\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\n(s^\\frown\\langle\\sigma(s)\\rangle\\in T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(x\\upharpoonright n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\n\\to x(n)=\\sigma(x\\upharpoonright n)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A strategy is defined exactly at legal, nonterminal positions belonging to its player; compatibility is required only where the strategy is defined.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-game2-play-branch.md","status":"resolved","id":"d8896797273e3015","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-game2-play-branch.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-game2-player-turn.md","status":"resolved","id":"747a450d8e1c888a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-game2-player-turn.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,T,i,x,\\sigma\\in V,\\ T\\subseteq A^{<\\omega},\\ i\\in2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2RunCompatibleStrategy}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayBranch}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayerTurn}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game2\\text{-}run\\text{-}compatible\\text{-}strategy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2RunCompatibleStrategy}_S(x,\\sigma,i,T,A)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayBranch}_S(x,T,A)\\\\\n&\\land\\operatorname{Function}\\!\\left(\n\\sigma,\n\\left\\{s\\in T:\\mathrm{ZfcGame2PlayerTurn}_S(i,s,A)\n\\land\\exists a\\in A\\;(s^\\frown\\langle a\\rangle\\in T)\\right\\},A\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\\;\n(s^\\frown\\langle\\sigma(s)\\rangle\\in T)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(x\\upharpoonright n\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma)\n\\to x(n)=\\sigma(x\\upharpoonright n)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1668,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-game2-run-compatible-strategy.md|58-df-zfc-game2-run-compatible-strategy]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d8896797273e3015","747a450d8e1c888a","36d7463d215be751"]}